wasm: transitional package
==========================

WASM was renamed to Noust in 3.0.0. This package contains nothing: it only
depends on noust, so that upgrading a server that has wasm (Debian, Ubuntu)
or wasm-cli (Fedora, openSUSE) installed brings noust in.

The command is noust; wasm remains an alias for the whole 3.x series. This
package can be removed once noust is installed.

https://github.com/Perkybeet/noust
